*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CLM0009
*> PURPOSE : INSURANCE CLAIMS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-01-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 500
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CLMNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0009.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> CLAIM TYPE A=AUTO H=HOME M=MEDICAL
    05 CLM-TYPE-CD        PIC X.
    *> CLAIMED AMOUNT
    05 CLAIM-VALUE        PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 POLICY-DEDUCT      PIC 9(5)V99.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 CLAIM-PAYOUT       PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
    05 CLAIM-STATUS       PIC X VALUE 'A'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM CALC-PAYOUT
    DISPLAY "CLAIM-PAYOUT=" CLAIM-PAYOUT
    DISPLAY "CLAIM-STATUS=" CLAIM-STATUS
    STOP RUN.
CALC-PAYOUT.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN CLM-TYPE-CD EQUAL TO 'M'
            COMPUTE CLAIM-PAYOUT = CLAIM-VALUE * 0.70
        *> DEDUCTIBLE APPLIES
        WHEN CLAIM-VALUE GREATER THAN 0
            COMPUTE CLAIM-PAYOUT = CLAIM-VALUE - POLICY-DEDUCT
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0 TO CLAIM-PAYOUT
            MOVE 'D' TO CLAIM-STATUS
    END-EVALUATE.
